 Virtual Worlds SOS (State of Standards) Q3-2008</article-title><source>J. Virtual Worlds Res</source><year>2008</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><comment>(<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://journals.tdl.org/jvwr/article/view/359/271">http://journals.tdl.org/jvwr/article/view/359/271</ext-link>).</comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="b46-ijerph-05-00290"><label>46</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Metaverse1 EU Project Consortium</collab></person-group><source>Requirements for MPEG-V Version 3</source><publisher-name>International Organization for Standardization (ISO)</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Busan, Korea</publisher-loc><month>10</month><year>2008</year><comment>(<ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.chiariglione.org/mpeg/working_documents/mpeg-v/mpeg-v_Reqs.zip">http://www.chiariglione.org/mpeg/working_documents/mpeg-v/mpeg-v_Reqs.zip</ext-link>).</comment></element-citation></ref><ref id="b47-ijerph-05-00290"><label>47</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wilson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Dai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Jakupovic</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Watson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Meng</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Supercomputing with toys: harnessing the power of NVIDIA 8800GTX and playstation 3 for bioinformatics problem</article-title><source>Comput Syst Bioinformatics Conf</source><year>2007</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>387</fpage><lpage>390</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17951841</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="b48-ijerph-05-00290"><label>48</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names