h-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 5</label><caption><p>A 3D HIV Cell Model at Karuna Island.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f5"/></fig><fig id="f6-ijerph-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 6</label><caption><p>A &#x02018;raising awareness&#x02019; edutainment artefact at the University of Plymouth Sexual Health SIM in Second Life<sup>&#x000ae;</sup>[<xref rid="b13-ijerph-05-00290" ref-type="bibr">13</xref>]. This free virtual condom dispenser dispenses two 3D male condom objects to user&#x02019;s inventory, plus an information Notecard on how to use a (real) male condom.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f6"/></fig><fig id="f7-ijerph-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 7</label><caption><p>Tox Town&#x02019;s HUD in Second Life&#x000ae;. The HUD can be repositioned around the user&#x02019;s screen according to user&#x02019;s preference.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f7"/></fig><fig id="f8-ijerph-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 8</label><caption><p>The teleport map in Tox Town&#x02019;s Welcome Area.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f8"/></fig><fig id="f9-ijerph-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 9</label><caption><p>Bathroom in Jefferson&#x02019;s Adaptation Home.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f9"/></fig><fig id="f10-ijerph-05-00290" position="float"><label>Figure 10</label><caption><p>Carpal tunnel exhibit (snapshot by SL:Knoh Oh).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="ijerph-05-00290f10"/></fig></floats-group></article>